        "description": "I have a bottle of Galliano, and none of the mixers I could find that other recipes called for to go with it. So I improvised and came up with a nice lite aperitif. Freshies™ Sweet and Sour mix is the only one I&#39;d use, or Stirrings® Lemon Drop. The quality fresh ingredients and lack of fillers or preservatives is vital to maintain the purity of Galliano, and to keep it in context of it&#39;s digestive properties.",
